ep harvest season","commission":"activity affiliate / DMC add-on","wells":["eat"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure","expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"evidenced","culinary":"destination","expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":["DMC","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane","si_basis":"the dossier''s own SI block filed this jewel under a heading resolving to ''adventure'' via ruled RULES. Not a keyword match on the jewel text."},{"name":"Ruta del Vino Bike Ride / wine-country cycling","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.hotelboutiquevalledeguadalupe.com/activities-valle-de-guadalupe-ensenada","hook":"road race and fun ride held annually at the wine capital each July; boutique hotels offer bike-trip services","si":"expedition","blurb":"road race and fun ride held annually at the wine capital each July; boutique hotels offer bike-trip services","commission":"event/activity + lodging","wells":["stay","activities","shop"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"destination","expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":["event"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane"},{"name":"Ensenada — La Bufadora + fish-taco origin + seafood","tier":"essential","source":"https://kanaletravels.com/catch-of-the-day-foodies-fish-taco-tasting-adventure-in-ensenada/","timing":"Fiestas de la Vendimia harvest festival — early-to-late August 2026 , within a warm/dry Jul–Sep harvest season","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"one of the world''s largest marine geysers, plus the Mercado Negro that birthed the Baja fish taco","si":"expedition","blurb":"one of the world''s largest marine geysers, plus the Mercado Negro that birthed the Baja fish taco","when":"Fiestas de la Vendimia harvest festival — early-to-late August 2026 , within a warm/dry Jul–Sep harvest season","commission":"guided coastal-day add-on; market self-guided","wells":[],"wells_basis":"text supports no Well — needs a human read","si_all":["culinary","expedition"],"shelf_fit":{"culinary":"evidenced","expedition":"primary"},"commission_lane":["guide"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"lane","si_raw":"GEA/Culinary","si_map_basis":"normalised from free text ''GEA/Culinary'' by gen_normalise_jewel_si"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"Drink-and-drive is the number-one fire. The entire product is tasting across a dispersed valley on rural, partly unlit Highway 3 — so the mandatory design answer is a designated driver or guided wine tour, never a self-drive tasting circuit. Keep to daylight transfers, and note serious trauma routes north across the border to San Diego.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"What makes Valle de Guadalupe worth the trip?","a":"It''s Mexico''s wine country fused with world-class food. 100+ wineries along the Ruta del Vino make 90%+ of Mexican wine (Monte Xanic, Adobe Guadalupe, Vena Cava), and the Baja Med table — Michelin-star Deckman''s en el Mogor, Fauna, Finca Altozano — is the second draw. Most cellars and restaurants require reservations.","source":"exploremexico.blog / bestmexicanwinetours.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culinary-&-gastronomy-—-future","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"When is the Vendimia harvest festival?","a":"Roughly early-to-late August (an Aug 5–23 window in 2026), within a warm/dry July–September harvest. Fiestas de la Vendimia is the demand apex — 80+ wineries pouring 160+ labels, the paella competition, pairing dinners — and lodging plus event tickets sell out first, so lock scarce inventory before the early-July climb.","source":"zonaturistica.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"culinary-&-gastronomy-—-future","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"Is Valle de Guadalupe good for a honeymoon?","a":"Yes — it is a design-lodge couples'' and elopement market. Banyan Tree Veya (30 villas, on-site Grenache winery, spa/Temazcal, seven dining experiences) is the ultra anchor, with Encuentro Guadalupe''s 20 stilted EcoLofts and Bruma for design-luxury; spring and fall shoulders give the full experience without the Vendimia crush.","source":"banyantree.com / mrandmrssmith.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"romance","accessed":"2026-07-07"},{"q":"What is there to do besides drink wine?","a":"Fly over it or ride through it. A sunrise hot-air balloon climbs ~2,000 ft over the vineyards for 45–60 minutes with a sparkling-wine toast, Adobe Guadalupe offers Azteca sport-horse vineyard rides (~$70/hr), and the annual Ruta del Vino bike ride rounds out the soft-adventure spine — all operator-run.","source":"explorevdg.com / explorenowornever.com, 2026-07-07","si_tag":"expedition","accessed":"2026-07-07"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Valle de Guadalupe, Mexico — Baja Wine Country Guide (Wineries, Baja Med & Vendimia) | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"Plan Mexico''s premier wine country: 100+ Valle de Guadalupe wineries, Baja Med farm-to-table, the August Vendimia harvest festival, design wine-lodges, and Ensenada — with straight State-Dept safety guidance. TravelWell.","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["Valle de Guadalupe viñedos","ruta del vino Baja","Vendimia Ensenada","hoteles boutique Valle de Guadalupe","Baja Med restaurantes"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"primary_keyword":"Valle de Guadalupe","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-08-20","last_verified_basis":"safety.fcdo.read","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/mexico","read":"2026-08-20T14:49:02Z","source_updated":"2026-07-16T16:08:09+01:00"}]},"content_freshness":"2026-07-07","long_tail":["Valle de Guadalupe wineries","Valle de Guadalupe wine tour designated driver","best Baja Med restaurants Valle de Guadalupe","Fiestas de la Vendimia dates 2026","San Diego to Valle de Guadalupe drive","is Valle de Guadalupe safe"]},"booking":{"advisory_authority":"FCDO"},"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"culinary","status":"live"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Banyan Tree Veya Valle de Guadalupe","earning":"Virtuoso/Fora preferred; commissionable nightly + F&B/spa incrementals","mor":"hotel-direct via consortia","tier":"ultra/premier"},{"name":"Bruma","earning":"boutique-luxury commissionable","mor":"hotel-direct / Smith-style consortia","tier":"premier"},{"name":"Encuentro Guadalupe (Endémico)","earning":"Design Hotels / Grupo Habita consortia commissionable","mor":"hotel-direct","tier":"premier / design"},{"name":"Casa Frida","earning":"boutique commissionable / villa-rung MoR","mor":"hotel-direct / villa channel","tier":"comfort"}],"source_verified":null,"hero":{"query":"Valle de Guadalupe, Mexico, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":32.095,"lng":-116.6},"orbit":[{"id":"ensenada-mexico","jewels":8,"si":["tropical","expedition","romance","culinary"]}],"orbit_country":["akumal-mexico","bacalar-mexico","balandra-beach-mexico","cabo-pulmo-mexico","cabo-san-lucas-mexico","calakmul-mexico","campeche-city-mexico","cancun-mexico","careyes-mexico","celestun-mexico","chapala-ajijic-mexico","chichen-itza-mexico","coba-mexico","costalegre-mexico","cozumel-mexico","east-cape-mexico","espiritu-santo-island-mexico","guadalajara-mexico","guanajuato-city-mexico","holbox-mexico","huatulco-mexico","isla-contoy-mexico","isla-mujeres-mexico","izamal-mexico","la-paz-mexico","loreto-mexico","los-barriles-mexico","magdalena-bay-mexico","mahahual-mexico","mazamitla-mexico","merida-mexico","mexico-city-mexico","oaxaca-city-mexico","palenque-mexico","playa-del-carmen-mexico",