 a Dive Liveaboards sailing.","source":"zubludiving.com","si_tag":"diveglobal"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Bonaire Travel Guide: The Shore-Diving Capital, Marine Park & Nature Fee","meta_description":"Plan Bonaire - the shore-diving capital of the world: ~89 marked marine-park sites you drive up and walk into, the Hilma Hooker wreck, the $40 STINAPA nature fee, an on-island recompression chamber, flamingos and Lac Bay windsurf.","slug":"bonaire","primary_keyword":"Bonaire shore diving","long_tail":["Bonaire shore diving guide 2026","Bonaire National Marine Park dive sites","Hilma Hooker wreck dive","Bonaire STINAPA nature fee","Klein Bonaire boat dive","Lac Bay windsurfing"],"search_language":"nl","local_keywords":["Boneiru","Marine Park Boneiru","Hilma Hooker","STINAPA nature fee","Klein Bonaire","Lac Bay windsurf","Washington Slagbaai"],"hreflang":["en","nl"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-30","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-30","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/bonaire-st-eustatius-saba","read":"2026-08-19","source_updated":"2025-12-10T13:10:48+00:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"note":"Dutch green code; south of the hurricane belt; USD currency"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-30","hits":6,"misses":16,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; Dive Liveaboards is a hard MISS (shore/day-boat, NOT liveaboard); sports limited to participant; spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"diveglobal","name":"diveglobal","status":"live"},{"si":"t